52	   * — the label still exists as a real, readable text node (so `aria-label` above stays
53	   * fully redundant-but-consistent with the DOM the way it already is everywhere else in this
54	   * component), it just isn't rendered on screen. For a button whose Figma design is
55	   * icon-only (the mark itself carries the meaning) but which still needs a real accessible
56	   * name — see `zimmCartButtonGroup`'s Apple Pay / Google Pay buttons for the reference use.
57	   */
